[version]
1.3.0
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- BIOS Setup is back (F2) - now works via pcall for safety
- Plasma DE: fixed minimize button (windows now properly hidden)
- Plasma DE: taskbar buttons restore minimized windows
- Plasma DE: whole event loop wrapped in pcall - no more crashes
- Plasma DE: more applications in Kicker menu (19 apps now)
- Fixed random Unicode symbols appearing as garbage (replaced with ASCII)
- Shell now resets terminal colors after each command (no more palette mess)
- New GUI apps: clock, filemanager, terminal, system-monitor
- DE now starts before text login (DE handles login internally)
[/whatsnew]
